r, or a runtime folder and its `SYNC.md`. `create-skill` also hands its README step here.\n31:- `runtime-plugin-readme-template.md` for a folder a runtime loads its hooks from, or a hook mirror.\n36:- `security-policy-template.md` for a repository security policy.\n48:- **`readme`** fires on `readme`, `readme for`, `folder readme`, `create readme`, `write readme`, `project readme`, `skill readme`, `install guide`, `contributing guide`, `security policy`, `sync.md` and `sync doc for the` at weight 4. It selects the template the target names: `assets/skill-readme-template.md` for a skill package, `assets/architecture-template.md` for a skill package's `ARCHITECTURE.md`, a root-guide template for an install guide, contributing guide or security policy, `assets/hook-readme-template.md` for a hook folder, `assets/runtime-plugin-readme-template.md` for a plugin or extension folder, `assets/runtime-folder-template.md` for a runtime folder's README or `SYNC.md`, and `assets/readme-template.md` for everything else. It then loads the flat markdown inventory under `references/` and `assets/`.\n66:| Repository security policy | `SECURITY.md` at the repository root | `assets/security-policy-template.md` |\n109:    \"readme\": {\"weight\": 4, \"keywords\": [\"readme\", \"readme for\", \"folder readme\", \"create readme\", \"write readme\", \"project readme\", \"skill readme\", \"install guide\", \"contributing guide\", \"security policy\", \"sync.md\", \"sync doc for the\"]},\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\":\"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research && git show --stat --oneline 2d36805ea61 | head -20; echo \\\"=== create-readme router in commit? ===\\\"; git -c core.fsmonitor=false diff --name-only 2d36805ea61^ 2d36805ea61 | grep create-readme || echo \\\"not touched\\\"; echo \\\"=== current create-readme security policy line ===\\\"; grep -n \\\"security policy\\\\|hook mirror\\\\|git-hooks-check\\\\|spec-gate\\\" .skilled/skills/sk-doc/sk-create-readme/ROUTER.md | head\"}"},"time":{"start":1794852368817,"end":1794852370217}}}}
