e: goal rows Phase 039, sk-doc routing repair and Criterion 2 recheck after phase 039; packet_budget=ok\n59:- [x] T009 [C] Close the phase (`implementation-summary.md`). After T008. Verify: `validate.sh $PK/039-main-sk-doc-routing-repair --strict` prints `RESULT: PASSED`. Evidence: implementation-summary filled, acceptance criteria all Met, spec Complete, validate --strict RESULT: PASSED\n60:- [x] T010 [C] Fix review pass ten's single-quoted command P1 (`$ADV/lib/command-attach.ts`, `$ADV/tests/command-attach-guards.vitest.ts`). Verify: the quote cases fail without the fix. Evidence: a single quote is dropped only where it opens a command name; three cases fail without it, 167 pass with it; contractions keep their apostrophe\n61:- [x] T011 [C] Fix review pass ten's doctor install P1 (`.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-install-presentation.txt`, `doctor-install.yaml`, `scripts/tests/doctor-install-contract.test.cjs`). Verify: the contract passes and fails with main's wording. Evidence: the presentation names claude, codex, cursor, devin, dsh, opencode, pi and vibe from the manifest; the stale DSH sentence is gone from the workflow; the test reads the manifest; 17/17, and 16/1 with main's text; doctor tests 1266/0\n62:- [x] T012 [C] Rerun the gates after the pass ten fixes (`$SP/after-pass-ten.txt`). Verify: 0 failed both ways. Evidence: 2353 passed 0 failed with the flag unset and set, FLOOR 24/44 0/35 2/44, EVAL [160,49,21,5], stored sets unchanged; one doctor case failed only while the advisor dist rebuilt in parallel and passes 1266/0 on rerun\n103:- [x] CHK-001 [P0] The seven failures reproduced on the merged HEAD and clean origin/main (T001). Evidence: before.txt and the clean origin/main run\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\":\"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research && grep -n \\\"create-readme\\\\|mode router\\\\|router\\\" specs/system-skill-advisor/rout