{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794852923180,"sessionID":"ses_e1a82d916ffe3W1SLL4OkhFuu6","part":{"partID":"prt_1e591c9c0001KRv43cVsGGUody","sessionID":"ses_e1a82d916ffe3W1SLL4OkhFuu6","messageID":"msg_1e591bf42001XxkG2M8BU3h9AI","type":"tool","id":"call_1d466f127b224961a234cdac","tool":"write","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"{\n  \"type\": \"iteration\",\n  \"iteration\": 2,\n  \"run\": 2,\n  \"mode\": \"review\",\n  \"target_agent\": \"deep-review\",\n  \"agent_definition_loaded\": true,\n  \"resolved_route\": \"Resolved route: mode=review target_agent=deep-review\",\n  \"status\": \"complete\",\n  \"focus\": \"security and maintainability - retained cross-hub token footprint and the generation gate's dotted-phrase blind spot\",\n  \"dimensions\": [\"security\", \"maintainability\"],\n  \"filesReviewed\": [\n    \".skilled/skills/sk-doc/ROUTER.md:126-142\",\n    \".skilled/skills/sk-doc/ROUTER.md:218-220\",\n    \".skilled/skills/sk-doc/graph-metadata.json:340-395\",\n    \".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/skill-graph.json:1\",\n    \".skilled/skills/sk-doc/sk-create-skill/scripts/generate-router-intent-signals.cjs:12-122\",\n    \".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/scorer/text.ts:7-35\",\n    \".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/scorer/lanes/lexical.ts:60-105\",\n    \".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/scorer/lane-registry.ts:6-18\",\n    \"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/039-main-sk-doc-routing-repair/scratch/readme-probes.txt:1-11\",\n    \"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/039-main-sk-doc-routing-repair/spec.md:60-111\"\n  ],\n  \"findingsCount\": 5,\n  \"findingsSummary\": {\"P0\": 0, \"P1\": 0, \"P2\": 5},\n  \"findingsNew\": {\"P0\": 0, \"P1\": 0, \"P2\": 2},\n  \"findingDetails\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"F004\",\n      \"severity\": \"P2\",\n      \"title\": \"The narrowing removes the git and gate words but leaves the same cross-hub token class from the other named hooks\",\n      \"dimension\": \"security\",\n      \"file\": \".skilled/skills/sk-doc/ROUTER.md:219\",\n      \"evidence\": \"The prose at ROUTER.md:136-137 says git-* and spec-gate are not named because their names carry git, hooks and gate. After the removal the bag has no git and no gate, but hooks remains via codex-global-hooks-check (graph-metadata.json:358-359), and the retained names still inject env, secret, session, handover, decision, capture, dispatch, subagent, advisor, freshness, overlay, completion and quality into sk-doc's bag. Probe line 8 shows git hooks still reaches sk-git, so no present misroute is proven.\",\n      \"recommendation\": \"Reword the prose to the words actually removed, and either drop the remaining cross-domain names or restrict them to a full-phrase match that cannot fire on a bare hook-system prompt.\",\n      \"disposition\": \"active\",\n      \"findingClass\": \"class-of-bug\",\n      \"scopeProof\": \"Tokenized all 345 committed signals with the scorer rule (text.ts:31-35); intersected the 39 tokens from the 44 hook phrases with the 13 other hubs' bags; collisions exist for nine hubs.\",\n      \"affectedSurfaceHints\": [\n        \".skilled/skills/sk-doc/ROUTER.md\",\n        \".skilled/skills/sk-doc/graph-metadata.json\",\n        \".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/graph-metadata.json\",\n        \".skilled/skills/cli-external-orchestration/graph-metadata.json\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"F005\",\n      \"severity\": \"P2\",\n      \"title\": \"The generator's carry rule and its --check gate share a blind spot for dotted phrases\",\n      \"dimension\": \"maintainability\",\n      \"file\": \".skilled/skills/sk-doc/sk-create-skill/scripts/generate-router-intent-signals.cjs:57\",\n      \"evidence\": \"declaredPhrases keeps only phrases containing a space, so security.md and sync.md are never candidates. --check reports missing=0 while SECURITY_POLICY declares security.md as its only keyword (ROUTER.md:218) and neither generated artifact contains it. The packet probe still shows a SECURITY.md request topping sk-doc, so reach holds but the gate cannot verify it.\",\n      \"recommendation\": \"Teach the writer to carry dotted filename phrases, or add a gate case that flags an intent with zero carryable phrases; document the exclusion explicitly.\",\n      \"disposition\": \"active\",\n      \"findingClass\": \"matrix/evidence\",\n      \"scopeProof\": \"Computed declared vocabularies with and without the includes(' ') filter: 381 total, 328 multi-word; security.md and sync.md are excluded; ran --check --hub sk-doc and read missing=0.\",\n      \"affectedSurfaceHints\": [\n        \".skilled/skills/sk-doc/sk-create-skill/scripts/generate-router-intent-signals.cjs\",\n        \".skilled/skills/sk-doc/ROUTER.md\",\n        \".skilled/skills/sk-doc/graph-metadata.json\"\n      ]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"traceabilityChecks\": {\n    \"results\": [\n      {\n        \"protocolId\": \"spec_code\",\n        \"status\": \"pass\",\n        \"gateClass\": \"hard\",\n        \"applicable\": true,\n        \"evidence\": [\n          \".skilled/skills/sk-doc/ROUTER.md:218-220\",\n          \"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/039-main-sk-doc-routing-repair/spec.md:100-111\"\n        ],\n        \"summary\": \"The narrowed vocabulary matches the phase scope; F005 is a contract gap in a named integration surface.\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"protocolId\": \"checklist_evidence\",\n        \"status\": \"notApplicable\",\n        \"gateClass\": \"hard\",\n        \"applicable\": false,\n        \"evidence\": [\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/039-main-sk-doc-routing-repair/acceptance-criteria.md:56-58\"],\n        \"summary\": \"No packet checklist belongs to this review pass.\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"protocolId\": \"skill_agent\",